  "body": "It hasn't been ever implemented by neither Mozilla (see [1](https://wiki.mozilla.org/Platform/GFX/CanvasThingsWeDontPlanToSupport)), nor Chromium (see\n[2](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=251027)).\n\nNot sure what the status in other browsers is, but two major platforms have already marked it as wontfix.\n",
